        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: विनम्र",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विनम्र — vinamra — \"polite; humble\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मीरा बड़ों से हमेशा विनम्र होकर बात करती है। Mīrā baṛoṁ se hameśā vinamra hokar bāt kartī hai. Mira always speaks politely to her elders."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विनम्र (vinamra) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit vinamra, \"bent down, submissive, humble, modest\" (Monier-Williams): someone who bows a little."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
