          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चिढ़ाना (ciṛhānā) is the causative partner of ciṛhnā, \"to be provoked\", which CDIAL lists under ciḍ (CDIAL 4794): to make someone cross on purpose, usually in fun."
            }
          ]
        },
